Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tonight's plan just dropped in the family group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tulsi Vivah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.35,0:00:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ba's message: everyone in the courtyard at seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mummy asks who's bringing the sugarcane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pappa says: me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,At six-thirty Pappa asks: where do you even get sugarcane?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:21.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fai asks: shall I bring the dhol?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:25.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the nephew in America: please go live!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, Ba: wedding season starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get your outfits ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who's bringing what at your place tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:37.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell us in the comments. Follow Otlo.
